Maintainer: Adam B. Smith <adam.smith@mobot.org>
Description: Management of Monte Carlo Markov Chains produced by packages like
	'rstan', 'nimble', and 'rjags'. Makes extraction, subsetting, renaming,
	combining chains and other manipulations easier for humans, especially for 		
	variables that have indices like "gamma0", "gamma1", and "gamma2", or
	"beta[1, 1]", "beta[1, 2]", "beta[1, 3]", and similar. Includes functions
	for running 'nimble' models in batches that can be restarted from where
	they stopped.
Depends:
	R (>= 4.0.0)
Suggests:
	coda,
	nimble,
	omnibus
